DESCRIPTION:<p>Julia Roberts\, Paul Rudd\, Sarah Paulson\, Martin Freeman\
 , Greta Lee\, and Isaac Powell form the extraordinary Broadway company of 
 Bess Wohl&rsquo\;s acclaimed <em>Small Mouth Sounds</em>.&nbsp\;<br /><br 
 />Six strangers arrive at a retreat determined to escape their problems\, 
 turn inward\, and transform their lives. Spoiler: it does not go according
  to plan.<br /><br />From Bess Wohl\, author of last season&rsquo\;s Liber
 ation\, winner of the Pulitzer Prize for Drama and Tony Award for Best Pla
 y\, and Joe Mantello\, the three-time Tony Award-winning director of last 
 season&rsquo\;s <em>Death of a Salesman</em>\, comes a hilarious\, audacio
 us\, and utterly unpredictable theatrical event about searching for inner 
 peace and finding chaos instead.</p>
LOCATION:Barrymore Theatre\, 243 West 47th Street\, New York NY 10036
URL:https://www.telecharge.com/Small-Mouth-Sounds-Tickets
